new CancelledError(options?: CancelOptions): CancelledError;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L123","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:123"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CancelOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CancelOptions"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CancelledError"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"overrides","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overrides"}]},{"type":"code","value":"Error.constructor","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"revert","children":[{"type":"text","value":"revert?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional revert?: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L121","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:121"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"silent","children":[{"type":"text","value":"silent?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional silent?: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L122","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:122"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"overrides","text":"Overrides","level":4},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"revert","text":"revert?","level":3},{"id":"silent","text":"silent?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:120](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L120)\n\nThe error thrown by a `Retryer` (and surfaced to `query.promise`/`mutation`) when a fetch is cancelled, e.g. via\n`query.cancel()`. `revert`, if `true`, tells the caller to restore the state the query was in before the fetch\nstarted instead of surfacing the error. `silent`, if `true`, tells the caller to suppress this error and instead\nresolve with the promise of the fetch that triggered the cancellation.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nquery.cancel()\n\ntry {\n  await query.promise\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof CancelledError) {\n    // the fetch was cancelled, e.g. via `query.cancel()`\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Error`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew CancelledError(options?: CancelOptions): CancelledError;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:123](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L123)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options?\n\n[`CancelOptions`](../interfaces/CancelOptions.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`CancelledError`\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nError.constructor\n```\n\n## Properties\n\n### revert?\n\n```ts\noptional revert?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:121](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L121)\n\n***\n\n### silent?\n\n```ts\noptional silent?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:122](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L122)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CancelledError\ntitle: CancelledError\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:120](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L120)\n\nThe error thrown by a `Retryer` (and surfaced to `query.promise`/`mutation`) when a fetch is cancelled, e.g. via\n`query.cancel()`. `revert`, if `true`, tells the caller to restore the state the query was in before the fetch\nstarted instead of surfacing the error. `silent`, if `true`, tells the caller to suppress this error and instead\nresolve with the promise of the fetch that triggered the cancellation.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nquery.cancel()\n\ntry {\n  await query.promise\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof CancelledError) {\n    // the fetch was cancelled, e.g. via `query.cancel()`\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Error`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew CancelledError(options?: CancelOptions): CancelledError;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:123](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L123)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options?\n\n[`CancelOptions`](../interfaces/CancelOptions.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`CancelledError`\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nError.constructor\n```\n\n## Properties\n\n### revert?\n\n```ts\noptional revert?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:121](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L121)\n\n***\n\n### silent?\n\n```ts\noptional silent?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts:122](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts#L122)\n"}
